# ShellCheck configuration for install.sh, uninstall.sh and bin/ml-ai-skills.
# CI runs the version pinned in requirements-dev.txt (shellcheck-py) - see the ci.yml lint job.
#
# SC2329 (info, new in ShellCheck 0.11: "function is never invoked") is disabled because
# every current hit is a false positive: cleanup() is registered with `trap cleanup EXIT`,
# and release_lock / write_manifest / rollback_tx / kv_set are called from cleanup() or
# other trap-reached code, which ShellCheck does not follow. Measured 2026-10-27 with
# ShellCheck 0.11.0: these 8 SC2329 infos were the only findings across the three scripts.
disable=SC2329
